  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1908.02 Scope and Applicability. The requirements of this part shall apply to writers of individual health insurance that are subject to the association's plan of operation under RSA 404-G:5.\n\nSource. #10023, eff 11-14-11",
